From 08bb207e603146098ddec91afc9c549aca37d23b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hunterthelabguy <301055645+hunterthelabguy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:21:40 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] T2 as written

Red step shown (T1 build): the Filter test test_word_label_outside_h3_to_h5_fails
failed "'Question Label 3 to 5' not found in ... questions.lua:48: the Word
question box needs its colours" (the old filter reached word_box); the Word
tests failed "Lists differ: [] != [3, 3, 3, ...]" and "0 != N" (no QuestionLabel3
style, no label found). After the edits and a build, Filter 7 OK, but
MarkdownAndWord: 2 errors (test_word_box_holds_a_list_between_parts,
test_word_checkpoint_is_its_own_box: Pandoc exit 1) and 1 failure
(test_word_box_without_its_colours_fails: "needs its colours" not found; got
"question #a's label would be h2; tools/reference.docx has Question Label 3
to 5 only"). The tree is not green at this commit; F1 follows.
---
